{"word":"darnel","translation":"joio","definition_en":"A weedy annual grass that often grows in grainfields and other cultivated land; its seeds are sometimes considered poisonous.","definition_pt":"Uma erva anual espumosa que cresce em campos de grãos e outras terras cultivadas, suas sementes são às vezes consideradas venenosas.","example_en":"The farmer had to remove the darnel from his wheat field.","example_pt":"O fazendeiro teve que remover o joio do seu campo de trigo.","cefr_level":"C2","word_type":"noun","category_slug":"science","frequency_rank":null},
